OTA signing

Files: signing.key.pem and signing.cert.pem.

Generate a signing key and a self-signed development certificate:
  openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:3072 -nodes \
    -keyout signing.key.pem -out signing.cert.pem \
    -days 3650 -subj "/CN=NAOS OTA" \
    -addext "basicConstraints=critical,CA:TRUE"

The certificate becomes the RAUC trust certificate in the image.
Replace development signing material before distributing production firmware.
